  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkslateblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Fantastic-Matter Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/00/Keira%27s_eco_conversion.gif/revision/latest?cb=20241226035410\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Keira&#39;s eco conversion\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/00/Keira%27s_eco_conversion.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20241226035410\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/00/Keira%27s_eco_conversion.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20241226035410 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/00/Keira%27s_eco_conversion.gif/revision/latest?cb=20241226035410 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Keira&#39;s eco conversion\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Keira%27s_eco_conversion.gif\" data-image-name=\"Keira&#39;s eco conversion.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Keira Hagai (Jak and Daxter) can convert <b>dark eco</b> into other forms of <b>eco</b> to bestow Jak with eco skills.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Convert/transform fantastic-matter into other type of matter/energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>convert fantastic-matter into another form of matter/energy.</b> Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Manipulation\">Fantastic-Matter Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Absorption\">Fantastic-Matter Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Known_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Fantastic-Matter Recomposition</li>\n<li>Unobtainium Conversion/Recomposition</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can convert fantastic-matter into any form of matter or energy for usage. Some users can cause their conversions to have certain characteristics and properties such as healing. The subject can either be transformed completely, partially, permanently or temporarily depending on what level of power the user has, with some users being able to induce and reverse the effect at will.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Capacitor\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Capacitor\">Fantastic-Matter Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Enhanced_Condition\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Enhanced Condition\">Fantastic-Matter Enhanced Condition</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Constructs\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Constructs\">Fantastic-Matter Constructs</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Creation\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Creation\">Fantastic-Matter Creation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Transmutation\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Transmutation\">Fantastic-Matter Transmutation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Fantastic-Energy Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Conversion\" title=\"Radiation Conversion\">Fantastic-Radiation Conversion</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Absorption\">Fantastic-Matter Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Manipulation\">Fantastic-Matter Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May only be able to convert fantastic-matter into certain types of energies and/or elements.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/The_New_52\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:The New 52\">New 52</a> <a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Superman_(Clark_Kent)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Superman (Clark Kent)\">Kal-El/Clark Kent/Superman</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://deathstranding.fandom.com/wiki/Higgs_Monaghan\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:deathstranding:Higgs Monaghan\">Higgs Monaghan</a> (<i>Death Stranding</i>)</li>\n<li>Arch-viles (<i>Doom</i>)</li>\n<li>Barons of Hell (<i>Doom</i>)</li>\n<li>Hell Knights (<i>Doom</i>)</li>\n<li>Imps (<i>Doom</i>)</li>\n<li>Mancubi (<i>Doom</i>)\n<ul><li>Cyber-Mancubi</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://jakanddaxter.fandom.com/wiki/Keira_Hagai\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:jakanddaxter:Keira Hagai\">Keira Hagai</a> (<i>Jak and Daxter</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sonic.fandom.com/wiki/Enerjak\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:sonic:Enerjak\">Enerjak</a> (<i>Archie's Sonic the Hedgehog</i>)</li>\n<li>Extractors (<i>StarCraft</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Tempest Rigs (<i>Tempest Rising</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Locations\">Known Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D9&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-ar